| where (CommandLine contains " --buildcache " or CommandLine contains " --bhdump " or CommandLine contains " --certdump " or CommandLine contains " --dnsdump ") and (CommandLine contains " -c " or CommandLine contains " --cachefilename " or CommandLine contains " -o " or CommandLine contains " --outputdirectory")